  "description": "An easy to use, low overhead, yet high performing color picker for cross-platform .NET MAUI apps on Android and iOS.\n\nOn Android the picker opens as a native Material bottom sheet with a saturation/value panel, hue slider, optional alpha (transparency) slider, a row of recently picked colors and a built-in color palette — fully theme-aware including dark mode and rounded-corner shape theming. On iOS the native UIColorPickerViewController is used.\n\nZero third-party dependencies (only APIs .NET MAUI already ships with), fully unit tested, trimming and Native AOT compatible.\n\nSimple async API:\nvar color = await ColorPicker.PickColor(new ColorPickerConfig { Title = \"Pick a color\" });\n\nSupports live color-change callbacks for real-time previews, localizable labels and buttons, default color preselection and an optional non-dismissable mode.",
  "iconFile": "DocutainColorPickerLogo.png",
